        "Memory Subsystems & Chiplets",
        "Semiconductor Engineering"
      ],
      "text": "Using both a deterministic fault-injection model and physical end-to-end Rowhammer reproduction on DDR3 and DDR4 memory equipped with Target Row Refresh (TRR), the authors demonstrate bounded read/write windows, secret disclosure, privilege escalation, and multi-tenant SQLite API key leakage, along with a probabilistic small-step operational semantics for memory fault reasoning.",
